/P 96 0 R
/E (The Americans and the Panama Canal. Although operated by the Panamanian Government since 2000, the U.S. funded the majority of the construction back in 1900-1914. But, president Trump strongly disagrees with the treaty and threatens to take it back.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [3]
>>
